    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya mambo higa, mfalume Ahasuero wamkpweza cheo mtumishiwe mmwenga yeihwa Hamani mwana wa Hamedatha, wa chivyazi cha Agagi. Achimuhenda akale mkpwulu wa maofisaage gosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alafu Mfalume achilavya lagizo kukala hinyo ahumwa osi a mfalume ariokala hipho phakpwe ryangoni azame na kudzibwaga mbere za Hamani kumuabudu. Na hinyo ahumwa osi achihenda hivyo ela Modekai kayahenda bii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi hinyo ahumwa anjina achimuuza Modekai kpwa utu wani unavundza lagizo ra mfalume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Modekai achiamba kukala kaweza kumzamira Hamani kpwa sababu iye ni Myahudi. Hara ahumwa achimuambira Modekai kano nyinji kuhusu kuvundza lagizo ra mfalume ela Modekai kayalonda kuasikira. Phahi ariphoona kukala kaasikira, achimsema na Hamani ili alole napho Modekai andaenderera na imaniye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamani ariphoona kukala Modekai kamzamira au kudzibwaga, achitsukirwa sana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela ariphoambirwa kukala Modekai ni Myahudi achiona kukala kumuolaga Modekai macheye takutosha bii, njira nono ni kumuolaga iye phamwenga na Ayahudi ariokala katika utawala wa Ahasuero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katika mwezi wa mwandzo, wa Chiyahudi uihwao Nisani, mwaka wa kumi na mbiri wa utawala wa Ahasuero, kura zapigbwa mbere za Hamani ili atsambule mwezi na siku ndiyoolagira Ayahudi. Kura ziriphopigbwa zichigbwerera mwezi wa kumi na mbiri wa Chiyahudi uihwao Adari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hipho Hamani achigomba na mfalume Ahasuero achiamba, “Phana kabila mwenga ambaro atue akagota majimbo gosi ga utawalao. Atu a kabila hiri taaelewana na atu anjina tse. Shariya zao zitafwauti na za atu anjina osi. Tsona higo malagizogo uwe mfalume, taagalunga bii. Kpwa hivyo naona sio vinono kukala atu hinya uariche aenderere kuishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi ichikala hivi nchivyogomba vinakuhamira, lavya shariya kukala aolagbwe nami nndalavya talanta elufu kumi za feza ziinjizwe kpwenye akiba ya mfalume ili zigarimie hinyo atu ndiohenda kazi hiyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamani ariphoricha kugomba, mfalume achivula kare peteye ya kupigira muhuri iriyokala mwakpwe mkpwononi achimupha Hamani wa Hamedatha wa chivyazi cha Agagi, adui wa Ayahudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalume achimuamba, “Nakupha pesa na atu ndiohenda kazi hiyo. Hivyo uonavyo ni sawa vihende.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi siku ya kumi na tahu ya mwezi wa mwandzo, Hamani achiaiha aandishi a mfalume achiandika baruwa dza viratu arivyoalagiza. Baruwa hizo zaandikpwa kpwa dzina ra mfalume Ahasuero na zichiphirikpwa kpwa akulu a maliwali, maliwali osi arioimirira majimbo na vilongozi osi a chila kabila kpwenye majimbo gosi. Baruwa hizo zaandikpwa kulengana na luga ariyogomba hinyo atu ariophirikirwa na kulengana na maandishi na luga arizogomba atu hinyo. Nazo zichipigbwa muhuri wa pete ya mfalume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baruwa hizo zichiphirikpwa ni atu kpwenye majimbo gosi ga mfalume. Zalavya uamuzi kukala Ayahudi osi avyere na adide, achetu na ana atsanga aolagbwe kpwa siku mwenga na vitu vyao vihalwe. Kazi iyo kala indahendwa siku ya kumi na tahu ya mwezi wa kumi na mbiri wa Chiyahudi uihwao Adari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chila jimbo kala ni riphirikirwe kopi ya baruwa iyo kama shariya ili atu osi adzitayarishe kpwa siku hiyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baruwa hizo zichiphirikpwa upesi sana, kulengana na shariya ya mfalume. Lagizo hiro piya richilaviwa hadi Susa kaya pha mfalume. Phahi Hamani na mfalume achisagala achinwa ela mudzi wosi wa Susa uchimenya wuoga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
